; Ethos-zero ordinary signal — the generation wire contract.
;
; The connection carries signal's exchange layer. A peer greets once,
; settling this contract by the digest of its Library and this file; after
; that every query opens an exchange the peer names. Generate and Observe
; are answered with one frame on that exchange, which then ends. Subscribe
; answers on its exchange with each generation event until the peer
; abandons the exchange.
Signal
[ signal_ethos_zero:[ SourceName RelativePath FileLocation ] ]
[ Generate.FileLocation
  Observe.[ Assemblies ]
  Subscribe.FileLocation
  Unsubscribe.FileLocation ]
[ Generated.Generation
  Observed.[ Assemblies.Vector<Generation> ]
  GenerationRejected.GenerationRefusal
  GenerationStarted.FileLocation
  GenerationCompleted.Generation
  GenerationRefused.GenerationRefusal ]
[ Generation.{ FileLocation
               ArtifactPath.String }
  GenerationRefusal.[ UnknownSource.SourceName
                      FileAbsent.FileLocation
                      ImportUnresolved.FileLocation
                      InvalidRelativePath.RelativePath
                      InvalidEthos.{ Extent.{ Start.Integer
                                              End.Integer }
                                     Reason.String }
                      RustProjectionRejected.String ] ]
